  m_text: 'SHADOW TILE ESCAPE

    Design, programming, level design, UI, geometric
    game art, and generated feedback tones: Moonlit Loom Games.


    NUNITO SANS

    Copyright
    The Nunito Sans Project Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
    The font and license are bundled with the game project.


    ANKLEBREAKER UNITY
    MCP

    Development tooling by AnkleBreaker Studio. Unity plugin v2.39.5 and
    server v2.35.6 used under the AnkleBreaker Open License v1.0.


    OPENAI IMAGE
    GENERATION

    Original Shadow Tile Escape app icon generated for this project
    with OpenAI built-in ImageGen.


    UNITY PACKAGES

    Unity Engine, Universal
    Render Pipeline, Input System, TextMesh Pro, uGUI, Test Framework, Performance
    Testing, Mathematics, and their transitive Unity packages are used under their
    applicable Unity package terms.


    AUDIO & ART

    Ambient loop and interface
    cues are original editor-generated waveforms. All remaining UI geometry and icons
    are original project-authored assets. No paid or copied icon packs are used.'
